338
00:41:02,689 --> 00:41:06,729
すべきことは 分かっているから
I know what I have to do.

339
00:41:07,129 --> 00:41:10,569
Take this pain away from me,

340
00:41:10,669 --> 00:41:13,809
この胸の奥底に乗せて
carrying it deep within my chest.

341
00:41:13,969 --> 00:41:20,969
There's no way I can fail me, go get that wish you've ever had!
There's no way I can fail, go get that wish you've ever had!

342
00:41:35,325 --> 00:41:39,405
Got down the reason why I'm standing near alone,

343
00:41:39,405 --> 00:41:42,425
Maybe it's already too late to regain.

344
00:41:42,605 --> 00:41:47,625
夢を閉じて掲げた日を失さないで
Don't lose the day you held up with closed dreams.

345
00:41:47,805 --> 00:41:50,645
Face yourself, don't forget this is your fate.

346
00:41:51,205 --> 00:41:55,025
