347
00:41:55,025 --> 00:41:58,105
It's not enough, it's not enough for me

348
00:41:58,105 --> 00:42:04,585
To break the rule upon this world!
to break the rules upon this world!

349
00:42:04,725 --> 00:42:07,945
I will never gonna leave you, never wanna lose you,

350
00:42:07,945 --> 00:42:11,365
I'll make it in the end!

351
00:42:11,365 --> 00:42:14,045
Not backing down for real,

352
00:42:14,045 --> 00:42:17,525
I won't chase someone else's life.

353
00:42:18,185 --> 00:42:20,225
I know who I am.

354
00:42:59,245 --> 00:43:16,345
待っていたのは この瞬間
