逃げ出したくなったら 空を見上げよう
If you ever want to run away, look up at the sky.

389
00:46:40,490 --> 00:46:45,490
勇気こそが輝くんだよ Singing star
Courage is what truly shines, Singing star.

390
00:47:22,190 --> 00:47:27,490
遥かかなた 星が音楽となったかの日
Far away, on the day when stars became music,

391
